    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089c84b4ae2253dac2dc29c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与大和赤骥之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02008e4cb975a699cd085a3fa57a7f9b50cdf98cb1b9427498c53cf4d5451b8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
