      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是那个啊，那个！！\n我在商店街抽到之后给你保管的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dda080e22159a8ca9d13bcbccd4bd5df6f3c9606d5faece9f97185aee421d39",
